PLT Scheme version 301 is now available from

    http://download.plt-scheme.org/

Version 301 is a minor update of v300 to repair one serious bug:

 * When a graphical DrScheme file contains a byte string that is
   longer than 64 bytes, opening the file could sometimes crash
   DrScheme.

In addition, v301 repairs a few minor bugs. For example, the "Collapse
S-expression" editor operation no longer inserts garbage whitespace
into the collapsed expression, right-clicking a parenthesis in text
mode does not trigger an internal error, the debugger status display
is fixed for Unix/X, and the planet --remove flag works correctly.

Feedback well, come.
